#: ../../tools/ensembl_variation_ext_tools.rst:32
#: a3c9cfddeccc49bb95984480bf9be6b2
#, python-format
msgid ""
"**Description**: Get allele frequency data for a variant (SNP/indel) "
"across global populations from gnomAD and 1000 Genomes via Ensembl. "
"Returns allele frequencies broken down by population (e.g., gnomADe:ALL, "
"gnomADe:nfe, 1000GENOMES:phase\\_3:CEU, etc.). Essential for assessing "
"variant rarity in different ethnic groups, interpreting clinical "
"significance, and population genetics studies. Example: rs429358 (APOE "
"epsilon-4 allele) shows C allele frequency of 14.8% globally (gnomAD), "
"22.7% in African populations, 9.8% in East Asian populations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ensembl_variation_ext_tools.rst:34
